600
00:51:02,550 --> 00:51:05,690
But as you're getting closer,
the radius of this little ball

601
00:51:05,690 --> 00:51:07,610
have to be smaller.

602
00:51:07,610 --> 00:51:10,160
But that's fine.

603
00:51:10,160 --> 00:51:15,860
So this is what it means
