619
00:52:32,080 --> 00:52:37,960
So you just should be careful
with what the set is--

620
00:52:41,740 --> 00:52:43,310
what set [INAUDIBLE].

621
00:52:50,140 --> 00:52:53,090
So now the key here is that--

622
00:52:53,090 --> 00:53:01,720
so if you have an open set,
how do you construct a--

623
00:53:01,720 --> 00:53:04,060
well, maybe the first
