632
00:53:38,160 --> 00:53:40,140
But they're not
very interesting.

633
00:53:40,140 --> 00:53:45,360
So a more interesting example is
that if you take a metric space

634
00:53:45,360 --> 00:53:47,050
and you take a ball--

635
00:53:47,050 --> 00:53:50,410
and now it's crucial
how we define the ball.

636
00:53:50,410 --> 00:53:56,010
And so it's crucial that
