708
00:58:58,930 --> 00:59:01,480
So this means that
this thing here,

709
00:59:01,480 --> 00:59:06,180
this thing here is
strictly less than s.

710
00:59:06,180 --> 00:59:13,760
And so you see that this thing
here is now less than d x,

