713
00:59:23,895 --> 00:59:30,060
s was equal to r minus d x, y.

714
00:59:30,060 --> 00:59:31,680
That was the definition of s.

715
00:59:31,680 --> 00:59:34,100
And so now you see
that this thing here

716
00:59:34,100 --> 00:59:37,830
is r because those
