722
00:59:55,080 --> 01:00:01,130
And again, the proof of it
was just from this picture

723
01:00:01,130 --> 01:00:04,730
that you make kind of rigorous.

724
01:00:04,730 --> 01:00:08,190
And the only nontrivial
things at the moment we really

725
01:00:08,190 --> 01:00:11,563
have in a metric space
is a triangle in concern

726
01:00:11,563 --> 01:00:13,355
because we haven't
built up a lot of stuff.

727
01:00:17,460 --> 01:00:20,580
So you see, this
immediately gives you

728
01:00:20,580 --> 01:00:29,470
